verifier errors in @f:
  inst0 `v4 = bswap v0`: bswap needs at least i16
  inst1 `v5 = clz v3`: clz takes an integer, got ptr
  inst2 `v6 = select v1, v1, v2`: select arms must have the same type, got (i32, i64)
  inst3 `v7 = select v3, v1, v1`: select condition must be an integer, got ptr
